{
  "source": "KingMinos OpenAPI resource inventory (public contract). Paths verified against live GET https://api.kingminos.com/openapi.json. Tool names are snake_case resource operationIds. Only operations whose effective security includes the bearer scheme are required MCP tools. This file is not application source.",
